WEBVTT

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:03.212
And so I began to feel myself doing less

00:03:03.236 --> 00:03:05.522
and thinking less

00:03:05.546 --> 00:03:06.861
and feeling less.

00:03:07.829 --> 00:03:09.567
It was a kind of nullity.

00:03:10.049 --> 00:03:12.044
And then the anxiety set in.

00:03:12.567 --> 00:03:16.259
If you told me that I'd have to be
depressed for the next month,

00:03:16.283 --> 00:03:19.522
I would say, "As long I know it'll be over
in November, I can do it."

00:03:19.546 --> 00:03:20.792
But if you said to me,

00:03:20.816 --> 00:03:24.129
"You have to have acute anxiety
for the next month,"

00:03:24.153 --> 00:03:26.472
I would rather slit my wrist
than go through it.

00:03:26.496 --> 00:03:28.054
It was the feeling all the time

00:03:28.078 --> 00:03:30.282
like that feeling you have
if you're walking